            <p>Only the URLs you send to us using our Service. We don't store your IP address nor anything else, and the URLs are imidiately mixed with millions (if not more) of other URLs already in our crawler/index</p>

            <br>

            <h3>Sharing of your data</h3>
            <p>We don't<b>.</b></p>
            <br>

            <h3>Transfer of Your Personal Data</h3>
            <p>Your information is processed in the Company's servers. It means that this information may be
                transferred to — and maintained on — computers located outside Your state, province, country or other
                governmental jurisdiction where the data protection laws may differ than those from Your jurisdiction.
            </p>
            <p>Your consent to this Privacy Policy followed by Your submission of such information represents Your
                agreement
                to that transfer.</p>
            <p>The Company will take all steps reasonably necessary to ensure that Your data is treated securely and in
